{"id":1,"date":"2021-08-14T23:21:57","date_gmt":"2021-08-14T20:21:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/?p=1"},"modified":"2022-05-15T00:58:27","modified_gmt":"2022-05-15T07:58:27","slug":"privit-svit","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/privit-svit\/","title":{"rendered":"Global Language Coverage"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>\/*! elementor - v3.5.6 - 28-02-2022 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style>\n<h1>Portuguese Translation Services<\/h1>\n<h5>Portuguese Translation Expertise<\/h5>\n<p>Nowadays <b>Portuguese<\/b> is one of the most important and most spoken language around the world. It is considered as the fasted-growing European language behind English. The Portuguese language has a presence on almost all of the continents. It is often wrongly thought that Portuguese is only spoken in Portugal and Brazil, but in fact it is the official language in nine countries: Portugal, Angola, Mozambique, Guinea-Bissau, Cape Verde, Timor-Leste, Equatorial Guinea, and S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 and Principe. In Portugal, the country of origin, Portuguese is spoken by more than 10 million of speakers, while in Brazil the estimated number of native speakers exceeded 186 million people! Portuguese is also spoken by about 679 000 people in the United States, having the largest communities in the world. Portuguese is also one of twenty official of the European Union, and an official language of NATO.<\/p>\n<p>Portuguese belongs to the Romance group of languages. The roots of the Portuguese language are based in the autonomous community of Galicia, in the north of Portugal and the northwest of Spain. Their language, Galician, was a mix of local dialects and common Latin, and around the 14th century, Portuguese emerged as a descendant language. Even today, speakers of Portuguese and Galician have no trouble understanding one another.<\/p>\n<p>Portuguese has two important dialects: <i>the European and the Brazilian<\/i>. Some aspects and sounds found in many dialects of Brazil are exclusive to South America, and cannot be found in Europe. Standard Portuguese was developed in the 16th century, basically from the dialects spoken from Lisbon and Coimbra. Brazilian Portuguese is different from the European in several respects, including several sound changes and some differences in verb conjugation, syntax and Phonology. As you can see there is no one \u201cneutral\u201d form of Portuguese meaning it can be a difficult task for Portuguese translators, because it should ensure the work is optimised for the intended audience, wherever they may be.<\/p>\n<p>ABC Language Solutions has an extensive expertise in translating and delivering effective translation services for use not just in Portuguese-speaking countries but all over the world. We translate all kinds of documents from\/to Portuguese including medical, legal, financial, scientific, business documents and many others.<\/p>\n<style>\/*! elementor - v3.5.6 - 28-02-2022 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"525\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/european-portuguese-vs-brazilian-portuguese-525x300-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/european-portuguese-vs-brazilian-portuguese-525x300-1.jpg 525w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/european-portuguese-vs-brazilian-portuguese-525x300-1-300x171.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 525px) 100vw, 525px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<p><strong>Our Portuguese translation services include, but are not limited to:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Document translation<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Localization<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Transcreation<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Interpreting<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Multilingual DTP<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Editing \/ proofreading<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Voice-overs<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Typesetting<\/p>\n<p>&#8211;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Audio and video transcription<\/p>\n<p>Whether you need a simple personal document translation or a translation of highly technical report, ABC Language Solutions is ready to help you! We provide professional, quick and certified Portuguese translation services that will help you communicate with confidence across the street or across the globe! <\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/contact\/\"><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"350\" src=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/1.jpg 400w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/1-300x263.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a><\/p>\n<h2>HOW CAN WE HELP YOU?<\/h2>\n<p>ABC Language Solutions has all necessary expertise and experience to provide Portuguese translation services that combine 100% accuracy, quality, commitment and client satisfaction.<\/p>\n<p><i>European Portuguese and Brazilian Portuguese<\/i> can be considered as two different languages with its own peculiarities. There are also other dialects that can be mutually intelligible, that is why it is very important for translators to have a good level of cultural and linguistic knowledge. If you want that translation to be a success, you need to ensure that the concept is not only understood but is also properly represented and is relevant to the local culture.<\/p>\n<p>ABC Language Solutions has a vast experience and knowledge to adapt your messages and documents to Portuguese speaking world. Our Portuguese-speaking linguists possess all necessary skills to adapt your content to foreign markets.<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1376\" height=\"884\" src=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/rio-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/rio-2.jpg 1376w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/rio-2-300x193.jpg 300w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/rio-2-1024x658.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/rio-2-768x493.jpg 768w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/rio-2-600x385.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1376px) 100vw, 1376px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<p>Do you want to know more about translations and translation industry? Subscribe to our monthly newsletter to receive updates on the best industry practices, reports, tips and exclusive offers that will help you avoid costly mistakes and save money. <strong><a style=\"color: #ff6600;\" href=\"https:\/\/mailchi.mp\/037fbdc0a857\/mailiinglist_main\">SUBSCRIBE NOW!<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Are you all set to go and just need to find out how much your translation costs and how soon it can be done? Contact us to request a free quote and we will get back to you as soon as possible, often within minutes.\u00a0<strong><a style=\"color: #ff6600;\" href=\"http:\/\/info.abc-lang.com\/Express-Quote\">REQUEST EXPRESS QUOTE NOW!<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Do you have more questions? Do you have a complex project and need to discuss the details? Contact us right now and we will get back to you as soon as possible.\u00a0<strong><a style=\"color: #ff6600;\" href=\"http:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/contact\">REQUEST INFORMATION NOW!<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<h2>Translation Tips: How to Make Your Portuguese Translation a Success<br \/>\n<\/h2>\n<p>Like any language, Portuguese has its own peculiarities, with many different dialects. Translating Portuguese documents can be a challenging task that demands not only professional translators, but also a thorough linguistic review and cultural understanding by a native language expert. Translator must fully understand the local words and expressions to avoid misunderstandings. We have a vast network of experienced linguists who can provide the high-quality Portuguese translation solutions meeting the deadlines and your budget expectations. There are two main dialects of Portuguese, European and Brazilian, that is why it\u2019s important to understand and proper represent their differences in the target language, and so only translators with a firm grasp of regional culture can be trusted to create work that produces the intended effect. We highly recommend that you contact a language professional to discuss how you may benefit from these specific services and ensure that your documents are properly and accurately represented in the Portuguese language.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Our team of translators are native Portuguese speakers and experts in different fields such as legal, technical, medical, marketing, localization and many others. Whether you need simple document translation services or require some with specific requirements, we have the best solution for you to suit your needs. With our team of native Portuguese translators, you can trust that your content will not only be translated to the correct dialect for your specific audience or business needs, but it will also resonate culturally.<\/p>\n<p>We pay great attention to every translation request and adhere to the highest industry standards, delivering 100% accurate translations of all kinds with fast turnaround time possible.<\/p>\n<p><b>Please <\/b><strong><a style=\"color: #ff6600;\" href=\"http:\/\/abc-lang.ca\/contact\">CONTACT US<\/a><\/strong><b>\u00a0us today to discuss your translation needs or to\u00a0<\/b><strong><a style=\"color: #ff6600;\" href=\"http:\/\/info.abc-lang.com\/Express-Quote\">REQUEST A FREE QUOTE<\/a><\/strong><b>.\u00a0We\u2019ll do the rest.<\/b><\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"266\" src=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/dollarphotoclub_95921137.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/dollarphotoclub_95921137.jpg 800w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/dollarphotoclub_95921137-600x200.jpg 600w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/dollarphotoclub_95921137-300x100.jpg 300w, https:\/\/abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/02\/dollarphotoclub_95921137-768x255.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Portuguese Translation Services Portuguese Translation Expertise Nowadays Portuguese is one of the most important and most spoken language around the world. It is considered as the fasted-growing European language behind English. The Portuguese language has a presence on almost all of the continents. It is often wrongly thought that Portuguese is only spoken in Portugal [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":897,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","forma